+{
+  "file": "src/agents.ts",
+  "snippet": "  maxTurns: 0,",
+  "cause": "The triage agent is configured with maxTurns: 0, so Genkit aborts with \"Exceeded maximum tool call iterations (0)\" as soon as the model tries to call a delegation tool (delegate_to_orderAgent) for an order question, while plain greetings never need a tool call and still succeed.",
+  "evidence": "Genkit's generate loop (@genkit-ai/ai/lib/generate/action.mjs:346-354) throws when currentTurn + 1 > maxTurns; a scratch reproduction with a fake model that always requests a tool returned \"ABORTED: Exceeded maximum tool call iterations (0)\" after one model call with maxTurns: 0 and completed with maxTurns: 4. The triage agent itself was not run end-to-end, since no API key is available here; the fix sets triage to maxTurns: 4 (matching orderAgent and covering maxDelegations: 3 plus the final reply), and tsc --noEmit passes."
+}
